@page "/not-found"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]
@layout MainLayout

@* Anonymous by necessity: UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute re-executes to this route through the
   full pipeline, including authorization. Behind the staff-only fallback policy (§6.5), an
   anonymous visitor who mistyped a /public/* URL got bounced to a Microsoft sign-in page instead of
   this one, and a signed-in non-staff member got access denied. Note this is a per-component
   attribute - NOT .AllowAnonymous() on the shared MapRazorComponents registration, which is the
   thing D15 forbids because it would expose every staff page. *@

<h3>Not Found</h3>
<p>Sorry, the content you are looking for does not exist.</p>